  "en": {
    "privacy": {
      "title": "Privacy Policy",
      "content": "XAI KOREA (hereinafter referred to as \"the Company\") values your personal information and complies with the Personal Information Protection Act.\n\n1. Items and Purposes of Personal Information Collection\nCollected Items: Name, Email, Inquiry Details\nPurpose of Collection: Responding to service inquiries, customer management, delivery of notices\n\n2. Period of Retention and Use of Personal Information\nPersonal information is destroyed immediately after the purpose of use is achieved or upon membership withdrawal, but may be stored for up to 3 years in accordance with relevant laws.\n\n3. Provision of Personal Information to Third Parties\nThe Company does not provide personal information to third parties without the user's consent.\n\n4. Entrustment of Processing\nThe Company entrusts only the tasks necessary for service operation such as email services (Gmail), web hosting (AWS), and data analysis (Google Analytics).\n\n5. Rights of Users\nUsers can request to view, correct, or delete their personal information at any time. For such requests, please contact contact@xaikorea.ai.kr.\n\n6. Privacy Officer\nName: Jaehwan Kim, CEO\nEmail: contact@xaikorea.ai.kr\n\n7. Notice of Changes\nThis policy is effective as of October 1, 2025.\n\nXAI KOREA complies with the Personal Information Protection Act and will never misuse user data for unauthorized purposes."
    },
    "terms": {
