      "content": "1. Purpose\nThe purpose of these Terms and Conditions is to prescribe the conditions and procedures for using the AI tax/accounting services provided by XAI KOREA (hereinafter referred to as \"the Company\").\n\n2. Service Content\nThe Company provides tax and accounting-related knowledge services based on LLM and RAG technology.\n\n3. Obligations of Members\nMembers are prohibited from providing false information, stealing others' information, or using the services for illegal purposes.\n\n4. Interruption and Change of Service\nThe Company may temporarily suspend the provision of services for system inspection or technical reasons.\n\n5. Indemnification\nThe Company does not guarantee the accuracy or completeness of the information provided and is not responsible for any judgments made by users based on such information.\n\n6. Governing Court\nAny dispute regarding these Terms and Conditions shall be settled by the Seoul Central District Court.\n\nThis Agreement defines the terms and conditions under which XAI KOREA provides its AI-based tax and accounting services."
